<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Vet Centers.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Merrill cuts Vet Centers.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it cut Veterinary Centers of America Inc to near-term neutral from buy, but maintained its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 10-3/8 Wednesday, just off its year low.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1730</p>
</text>
